---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="House Cleaning & Maid Services in Columbia & Howard County MD | Greenwood Cleaning LLC" 
  description="Professional residential cleaning, deep cleaning, and move-in/move-out maid services across Columbia (21044, 21045), Ellicott City (21042), and Clarksville MD. Licensed & insured."
>
  <script type="application/ld+json" is:inline>
  {
    "@context": "https://schema.org",
    "@graph": [
      {
        "@type": "HouseCleaningService",
        "@id": "https://www.greenwoodservicesllc.com/#business",
        "name": "Greenwood Cleaning Services LLC",
        "image": "https://www.greenwoodservicesllc.com/logo.png",
        "telephone": "+1-240-483-3381",
        "email": "info@greenwoodservices.net",
        "priceRange": "$$",
        "address": {
          "@type": "PostalAddress",
          "addressLocality": "Columbia",
          "addressRegion": "MD",
          "postalCode": "21044",
          "addressCountry": "US"
        },
        "geo": {
          "@type": "GeoCoordinates",
          "latitude": 39.2037,
          "longitude": -76.8610
        },
        "areaServed": [
          { "@type": "City", "name": "Columbia", "sameAs": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Columbia,_Maryland" },
          { "@type": "City", "name": "Ellicott City", "sameAs": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Ellicott_City,_Maryland" },
          { "@type": "City", "name": "Clarksville" },
          { "@type": "City", "name": "Fulton" },
          { "@type": "City", "name": "Highland" },
          { "@type": "City", "name": "Elkridge" },
          { "@type": "AdministrativeArea", "name": "Howard County" }
        ]
      },
      {
        "@type": "FAQPage",
        "mainEntity": [
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Are Greenwood Cleaning Services licensed and insured in Maryland?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "Yes, Greenwood Cleaning Services LLC is fully registered, licensed, and insured in the state of Maryland, giving homeowners complete protection and peace of mind."
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "Do you bring your own cleaning supplies and equipment?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "Yes, we arrive fully equipped with professional-grade vacuums, microfiber materials, and eco-friendly cleaning solutions tailored to your home."
            }
          },
          {
            "@type": "Question",
            "name": "What areas in Howard County do you service?",
            "acceptedAnswer": {
              "@type": "Answer",
              "text": "We serve all villages in Columbia (21044, 21045, 21046), Ellicott City (21042, 21043), Clarksville (21029), Fulton, Highland, Elkridge, and neighboring Maryland corridors."
            }
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
  </script>

  <main>
    <section class="hero">
      <div class="container hero-text">
        <h1>Top-Rated House Cleaning & Maid Services in Howard County MD</h1>
        <p>Reliable maid solutions and custom cleaning checklists tailored for homes in Columbia, Ellicott City, Clarksville, and surrounding Maryland areas.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section>
      <div class="container">
        
        <!-- Service 1: Recurring -->
        <div class="service-detail">
          <div class="service-text">
            <div class="service-title-wrap">
              <i class="fas fa-home"></i>
              <h2>Recurring Residential Maid Service</h2>
            </div>
            <p>Maintaining a spotless living space requires continuous care that busy schedules take away. Whether you live in a modern townhouse in <strong>Columbia</strong> (Villages of Wilde Lake, Kings Contrivance, River Hill) or manage a family home in <strong>Ellicott City</strong>, <span class="brand-highlight">Greenwood Cleaning Services LLC</span> provides dependable recurring cleaning plans (weekly, bi-weekly, or monthly).</p>
            <p>We arrive equipped with commercial vacuums and eco-safe supplies, preserving indoor air quality and consistent sanitation across Howard County homes.</p>
            <ul class="service-list">
              <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> High-and-low surface dusting, ceiling fan blades, and picture frames</li>
              <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> HEPA-filter vacuuming of carpets and damp-mopping hardwood/tile floors</li>
              <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Complete sanitation of bathroom fixtures, vanity mirrors, and shower stalls</li>
              <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Kitchen sanitization: countertops, backsplash, range exterior, and sink basin</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="/contact" class="btn-service-cta">Schedule Recurring Service</a>
          </div>
          <div class="service-image" role="img" aria-label="Residential living room and kitchen cleaning in Columbia MD" style="background-image: url('/service1_new.png');"></div>
        </div>

        <hr class="service-divider" />

        <!-- Service 2: Deep Cleaning (Reversed Layout) -->
        <div class="service-detail reverse-layout">
          <div class="service-text">
            <div class="service-title-wrap">
              <i class="fas fa-broom"></i>
              <h2>Deep Cleaning & Seasonal Refresh</h2>
            </div>
            <p>When regular upkeep is not enough, our intensive Deep Cleaning package restores your living space from top to bottom. Designed specifically for residences in <strong>Clarksville</strong>, <strong>Glenelg</strong>, and <strong>Highland</strong> undergoing spring revitalization, post-renovation dust removal, or first-time intensive sanitization.</p>
            <p>We tackle neglected areas, eliminating built-up grease, mineral deposits, stubborn bathroom soap scum, and hidden allergen buildup.</p>
            <ul class="service-list">
              <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Detail hand-washing of all baseboards, interior trim, and door frames</li>
              <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Deep scrubbing shower wall tile grout and glass door residue</li>
              <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Full interior & exterior microwave detailing and stove hood degreasing</li>
              <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Window sills, blinds wipe-down, and light switch plate sanitizing</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="/contact" class="btn-service-cta">Book a Deep Clean</a>
          </div>
          <div class="service-image" role="img" aria-label="Deep cleaning bathroom sink and tile surfaces" style="background-image: url('/service2_new.png');"></div>
        </div>

        <hr class="service-divider" />

        <!-- Service 3: Move-In / Move-Out -->
        <div class="service-detail">
          <div class="service-text">
            <div class="service-title-wrap">
              <i class="fas fa-box-open"></i>
              <h2>Move-In & Move-Out Cleaning Services</h2>
            </div>
            <p>Moving demands punctuality and strict cleanliness standards. Whether you are moving into a rental apartment in <strong>North Laurel</strong>, closing on a property in <strong>Savage</strong>, or managing tenant turnover in <strong>Jessup</strong>, our turnkey vacancy cleaning ensures a flawless inspection.</p>
            <p>Our comprehensive move-out checklist meets the strict standards of Maryland property management companies and real estate agents, helping tenants secure their full security deposit return.</p>
            <ul class="service-list">
              <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Interior & exterior scrub of kitchen cabinets, drawers, and shelving</li>
              <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Intensive oven interior degreasing and refrigerator deep clean</li>
              <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Deep vacuuming inside bedroom closets, laundry closets, and utility areas</li>
              <li><i class="fas fa-check-circle"></i> Sanitization of interior doors, hardware, thresholds, and light switches</li>
            </ul>
            <a href="/contact" class="btn-service-cta">Request Move-Out Estimate</a>
          </div>
          <div class="service-image" role="img" aria-label="Move out vacancy house cleaning supplies" style="background-image: url('/service3.png');"></div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Local Cleaning FAQ Section -->
    <section class="bg-light faq-section">
      <div class="container">
        <div class="section-header">
          <h2>Frequently Asked Questions About Our Cleaning Services</h2>
          <p>Everything you need to know about booking our professional maid team in Howard County, MD.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid-3">
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Are you licensed and insured?</h3>
            <p>Yes. Greenwood Cleaning Services LLC is fully licensed and carries comprehensive liability insurance in Maryland to protect your home and possessions.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>Do I need to supply cleaning tools?</h3>
            <p>No. Our crew brings all professional-grade equipment, commercial HEPA vacuums, and eco-conscious supplies needed for a spotless finish.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="card">
            <h3>What areas do you serve?</h3>
            <p>We serve Columbia (21044, 21045, 21046), Ellicott City (21042, 21043), Clarksville (21029), Fulton, Laurel, Elkridge, and neighboring communities.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section style="text-align: center; padding: 70px 0;">
      <div class="container">
        <h2>Ready for a Spotless Home?</h2>
        <p style="margin-bottom: 30px; font-size: 1.05rem;">Get your customized, free estimate in minutes. Serving homeowners throughout Howard County.</p>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn-hero">Get a Free Estimate</a>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>
</Layout>
